        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(agents): preserve Anthropic Retry-After for auto-retry backoff",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes #103849.\n\nAnthropic Messages transport dropped HTTP status and `Retry-After` on error responses, so auto-retry backoff ignored the server cooldown and could retry too aggressively after 429s.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n1. Preserve structured error metadata (`httpStatus`, `retryAfterSeconds`) through the Anthropic transport stream path into shared retry/session delay handling.\n2. **ClawSweeper P1 follow-up:** restore the documented `maxRetryDelayMs` contract — when the server cooldown exceeds a **positive** max, decline AgentSession auto-retry (do not clamp and retry early); when max is **0**, treat the cap as disabled and honor the full cooldown.\n\n## User Impact\n\nWhen Anthropic returns 429 with `Retry-After`, OpenClaw can honor the server cooldown. Long cooldowns above the configured max no longer get shortened into early silent retries.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Verification (narrow)\n\nHost: local macOS. Path-scoped closeout (full `pnpm check:changed` not used after prior stall):\n\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `vitest run` `src/llm/utils/retry.test.ts` | **12/12 pass** (over-cap → no_auto_retry; max 0 → unlimited) |\n| `vitest run` `src/agents/anthropic-transport-stream.test.ts` | **108/108 pass** |\n| `vitest run` `src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/run/assistant-failover.test.ts` | **33/33 pass** |\n| `vitest run` real loopback stub (no HTTP proxy) | **1/1 pass** |\n| `oxlint` on touched retry/session files | pass |\n\nCommit: `317961cef87c986f5a3bb34e09954f00d168f3dd` (rebased on current main)\n\n### Real behavior proof\n\n- **Behavior addressed:** (1) Anthropic 429 status + Retry-After reach retry policy; (2) AgentSession auto-retry declines when Retry-After exceeds positive `maxRetryDelayMs`; (3) `maxRetryDelayMs: 0` honors full cooldown.\n- **Environment:** local macOS; loopback HTTP stub through production transport; pure unit resolution of delay decision.\n- **Current-main contrast:** main drops Retry-After on Anthropic non-OK; prior PR revision clamped over-cap cooldowns to max and still auto-retried (CS P1).\n- **Exact steps after patch:**\n  1. `resolveAutoRetryDelayMs({ retryAfterSeconds: 3600, maxRetryDelayMs: 60000, ... })` → `no_auto_retry`\n  2. `resolveAutoRetryDelayMs({ retryAfterSeconds: 3600, maxRetryDelayMs: 0, ... })` → delay 3600000ms\n  3. Real stub: 429 + `retry-after: 30` → `httpStatus=429`, `retryAfterSeconds=30`\n- **Evidence after fix:** focused suites green as tabled above.\n- **Control check:** decision type is closed (`delay` | `no_auto_retry`); AgentSession returns false without sleeping on over-cap.\n- **Observed result after fix:** over-cap cooldowns no longer schedule shortened silent retries; metadata still projected from transport.\n- **What was not tested:** live `api.anthropic.com` account turn; full check:changed fan-out.\n\n## AI disclosure\n\nAuthored/assisted with AI (Grok). Addressed ClawSweeper P1 cap semantics and rebased on main.\n",
